review:
I’ve been using Instagram for years now and I must say it’s an excellent app, and there have been a lot of good improvements to it.

As a user I see many things lacking that I wish you could add/improve:

 1)To be able to delete one or more pictures from a post that contains multiple pictures;

2)To be able to edit pictures that have been already posted;

3)To be able to add pictures or videos from the gallery that were not shared on Instagram stories, to the story highlights;

4)To be able to search words/messages through a chat;

When you will solve all these small imperfections, Instagram will surely be complete! :)
